**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
.coverage

# Rust build artifacts — huge (100s of MB) and must never enter the build
# context or the rust-builder COPY layer, or every local cargo run busts
# the Docker cache and forces a full release recompile.
**/target/
